# Verify {{ project_name }}

Run in order and stop at the first failure:

```shell
uv run ruff format --check .
uv run ruff check .
uv run ty check
uv run pytest
uv lock --check
```

On failure: fix issues introduced by the current change, then rerun the failing command and everything after it. `uv run ruff format .` and `uv run ruff check --fix .` apply safe fixes automatically.

Report pre-existing or environment-related failures separately instead of working around them (no `# type: ignore`, `noqa` or skipped tests without the user's agreement).
